OpenGL/arrays/buffers.py and _buffers.py are library modules that cannot be
run (_buffers.py uses a relative import), so their shebangs are wrong; pkgdepend
took them for scripts and failed on the relative import.

https://github.com/mcfletch/pyopengl/pull/179

